# Afiliado IA

Siga `docs/ROADMAP.md` (roadmap canônico) e `docs/ROADMAP_FASES.md`. Uma fase por vez; não adiante escopo.

Published presells are English-only. The ad final URL is this app's
presell route. The affiliate hop is the CTA click, never a hidden
redirect and never a different page for ad reviewers.

Do not clone Flow Pages branding or templates. Do not add cloaking.
Keep this repo separate from mercados-autonomos and affiliate-ai-platform.
